WEBVTT

00:00:05.173 --> 00:00:07.007
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:00:50.885 --> 00:00:52.719
(THUNDER CONTINUES RUMBLING)

00:00:56.933 --> 00:00:58.016
(FLY BUZZING)

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:22.874
(CREATURE TRILLING)

00:01:35.096 --> 00:01:37.722
You'll be glad
to be rid of him, I expect.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:40.475
We'd be more than happy
to keep him here in custody.

00:01:40.643 --> 00:01:42.560
Six months are enough.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:45.355
It's time for him to answer
for his crimes in Europe.

00:01:46.107 --> 00:01:48.775
MR. ABERNATHY: President Picquery.
Mr. Spielman, sir.

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:51.444
Prisoner is secured and ready to travel.

00:01:57.702 --> 00:01:59.744
SPIELMAN: You've thrown
everything at him, I see.

00:01:59.912 --> 00:02:02.789
SERAPHINA: It was necessary.
He's extremely powerful.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.794
We've had to change his guard
three times. He's very persuasive.

00:02:08.671 --> 00:02:10.630
So we removed his tongue.

00:02:16.429 --> 00:02:20.348
PRISONERS: Grindelwald!
Grindelwald! Grindelwald!

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:21.933
(YELLING)

00:02:23.936 --> 00:02:27.105
PRISONERS: Grindelwald! Grindelwald!

00:02:32.987 --> 00:02:34.404
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:02:37.158 --> 00:02:39.200
SPIELMAN: The wizarding
community worldwide

00:02:39.285 --> 00:02:40.910
owes you a great debt, Madam President.

00:02:41.412 --> 00:02:43.079
Do not underestimate him.

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:49.919
Mr. Spielman,
we found his wand hidden away.

00:02:53.424 --> 00:02:54.632
Abernathy.

00:02:56.177 --> 00:02:58.219
And we found this.

00:03:03.893 --> 00:03:04.893
(SERAPHINA SIGHS)

00:03:10.733 --> 00:03:12.108
- (BOTH WHINNYING)
- Hiyah!

00:03:17.114 --> 00:03:18.406
(WIND HOWLING)

00:03:23.704 --> 00:03:25.038
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:52.524
No more silver tongue. Hmm?

00:04:01.742 --> 00:04:03.076
(GROANING)

00:04:21.095 --> 00:04:22.095
(BOTH HISSING)

00:04:22.179 --> 00:04:23.179
(SCREAMS)

00:04:28.811 --> 00:04:30.019
(SCREAMING)

00:04:36.235 --> 00:04:37.402
(ALL GROAN)

00:04:37.528 --> 00:04:38.653
(GASPS)

00:04:43.534 --> 00:04:44.576
(GASPS)

00:04:45.703 --> 00:04:47.203
- (SNARLS)
- (GASPS)

00:04:48.456 --> 00:04:49.581
(GRUNTS)

00:04:52.293 --> 00:04:54.002
(YELLING)

00:04:56.964 --> 00:04:58.715
(MUFFLED GRUNTING)

00:04:59.425 --> 00:05:00.425
(SPIELMAN SCREAMS)

00:05:17.818 --> 00:05:18.818
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:05:39.715 --> 00:05:40.715
(SCREAMS)

00:05:46.388 --> 00:05:48.389
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:06:06.325 --> 00:06:08.826
GRINDELWALD: You have joined
a noble cause, my friend.

00:06:12.498 --> 00:06:14.082
(MR. ABERNATHY COUGHING)

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.458
(CREATURE TRILLING)

00:06:15.876 --> 00:06:17.377
(GROANING)

00:06:19.129 --> 00:06:22.715
I know. I know. I know, Antonio.

00:06:22.841 --> 00:06:24.217
(PURRING)

00:06:29.348 --> 00:06:30.390
So needy.

00:06:32.351 --> 00:06:33.726
(WHIMPERING)

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:39.065
(SCREAMING)

